  "meta": {
    "title": "How chronicle builds a page",
    "kicker": "Architecture walkthrough",
    "description": "The story skill delegates to a read-only gatherer that turns connected tools into a facts file; Claude writes the story and drawings; chronicle build derives, checks, paints and renders on the author's machine; the page publishes as a private Artifact only after the author confirms.",
